\par\par \b \uc2  Indian rupee ends at near 3-year high, seen firm. \b0\par\par\uc2 457 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 August 2003\par 13:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BOMBAY, Aug 18 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee resumed its\par appreciation after a two-day pause to end at a near three-year\par high on Monday, helped by dollar inflows piled up over a long\par weekend.\par  \par     Traders said the gains were however capped by dollar buying\par by state-run banks acting on behalf of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The rupee          finished at 45.8500/8550 per dollar, off\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  the day's high of 45.83 but stronger than Thursday's close of \par \par \uc2  45.9025/9125. The market was closed on Friday for India's \par \par \uc2  Independence Day holiday. \par \par \uc2  "Supplies had bunched up at the nostro accounts of banks' \par \par \uc2  overseas branches over the three-day weekend," a chief dealer \par \par \uc2  at a foreign bank said. "And the outlook remains firm, with \par \par \uc2  only the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  holding the rupee back from a test of \par \par \uc2  45.75." \par \par \uc2  The rupee, which has now risen 4.64 percent against the \par \par \uc2  dollar since the start of January, last ended higher on \par \par \uc2  September 15, 2000 at 45.7750/7800. \par \par \uc2  Traders said comments from senior central bankers last week \par \par \uc2  signalling that the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  was not uncomfortable \par \par \uc2  with the rupee's appreciation had also backed sentiment. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Bimal Jalan on Thursday ruled out \par \par \uc2  the possibility that the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  to keep the rupee from rising further in the face of strong \par \par \uc2  inflows, terming such a move "unsustainable over any length of \par \par \uc2  time". \par \par \uc2  "All these comments indicate that they are more keen to \par \par \uc2  keep the investment inflows into the economy robust," a private \par \par \uc2  bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  A senior \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official also told members of the \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  Association of India on Saturday the \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  had no target for \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, although it was a \par \par \uc2  conscious policy to accumulate them. \par \par \uc2  Buoyant foreign investments, including portfolio flows into \par \par \uc2  Indian shares, and trade and expatriate remittances have all \par \par \uc2  bolstered the rupee. \par \par \uc2  Foreign funds have pumped in $1.57 billion into Indian \par \par \uc2  shares since May, more than twice the amount they invested in \par \par \uc2  the whole of last year, as they bet that corporate earnings are \par \par \uc2  set to jump on the back of a monsoon-led economic rebound. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     Forward premiums at the far end of the curve ended lower,\par helped by the firm outlook on the rupee.\par     The one-year dollar finished six basis points lower at 1.88\par percent.\par -------------------------------------------------------------\par                                   MARKET SNAPSHOT\par                                Monday's close      Previous\par close\par     Bombay Sensitive Index (pts)     3,977.73\par 3,921.20\par     Indian rupee (/$)            45.8500/8550\par 45.9025/9125\par     7.27 percent 2013 bond (%)        5.5293*\par 5.5314\par     Call money (%)                  4.80/5.00\par 4.80/5.00\par     6-mth annualised fwd premium (%)     2.00\par 2.00\par     * yet to close\par -------------------------------------------------------------.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030818dz8i00n02\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
