\par\par \b \uc2  RBI WATCH: Ctrl Bk's Hands Tied On Indian Rupee Rise \b0\par\par\uc2  By Anil Varma \par \uc2 740 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Mai 2003\par 09:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  A Dow Jones Newswires Column \par \par \uc2  MUMBAI -(Dow Jones)- The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unlikely to make intrusive \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to temper the rupee's sharp rise against the dollar for fear of swelling money supply that could threaten inflation. \par \par \uc2  In fact, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's resistance to the rupee's appreciation - a potential handicap to exports - appears to be caving in due to constraints on making \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  money supply-neutral in its open market securities sales. \par \par \uc2  But with the rupee at a two-year high against the dollar, Indian exporters have grounds to be worried over the impact on their revenues from a rising local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and subdued global demand. \par \par \uc2  Indeed, one foreign investment house forecasts India's export growth slowing to 6% in the current financial year, which ends March 2004, after an 18% expansion in the previous fiscal year. \par \par \uc2  Over the past 12 months, the rupee has risen 4.4% against the dollar after nearly a decade of depreciation, with India's relatively high interest rates and a globally weak dollar attracting strong \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflows to the country. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  watchers expect the rupee to continue rising, with some forecasting INR46 to the dollar by the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  In morning trading Wednesday, the pair was at INR46.78. \par \par \uc2  Although traditionally a staunch sentinel of exports, the RBI has offered surpassingly little resistance to the rupee's particularly sharp gains over the past two weeks. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be reluctant to resist the rupee's rise by aggressively buying dollars due to potential inflation dangers as the process would pump rupees into a financial system that is already short of assets to buy. In other words, too much money could end up chasing too few assets, causing price to rise. \par \par \uc2  The RBI has in the past expressed concerns over the potential fallout on inflation from extensive non-sterilized \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to contain potentially volatile gains in the local unit. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    Strong Money Supply Growth\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par As matters stand, money supply growth as measured by the broad M3\par aggregate is 15% on year, well above the 6% gross domestic product\par growth forecast for the current fiscal year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Some economists regard money supply growing faster than GDP as a\par warning sign for higher inflation.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par With a number of uncertainties already clouding the inflation horizon,\par the RBI appears to be staying its hand on the rising rupee to sustain\par its soft monetary policy stance.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par At its monetary and credit policy announcement in April, the RBI cut\par its bank rate - a key signaling tool for market-determined interest\par rates - by 25 basis points to a three-decade low of 6%.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par While policy rates are probably close to bottom in the current cycle,\par the challenge for the RBI is to keep interest rates as low as possible\par for as long as possible.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But an uncertain inflation outlook may be jeopardizing that stance. In\par April, the wholesale price index, which is used as a proxy for wider\par inflation, hit a two-year high of 6.47%.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par When caught between the policy challenges of curbing inflation and\par slowing a rapidly rising home \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , many central banks resort to\par sterilized \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Here, the impact of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on money supply is neutralized by\par draining local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  liquidity through open market securities sales.\par However, the RBI doesn't seem to be in a position to do this due to a\par sharp drop in its stock of domestic securities.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The RBI's domestic assets fell to just 9% of its average outstanding\par reserve money in the last fiscal year due to the impact of open market\par sales and changes in the composition of reserve money from rising\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves. A decade ago, the level was 90%.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Concerns about an adverse reaction in the government bond market to\par another open market securities sale, which would likely result in an\par unwelcome rise in yields, also appears to be hampering the RBI's ability\par to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The RBI's role as the government's debt manager puts demands on it to\par reduce federal borrowing costs by keeping market interest rates as low\par as possible.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Anil Varma, Dow Jones Newswires; 91 22 22884212;\par anil.varmadowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (Anil Varma covers India's money and fixed income markets for Dow\par Jones Newswires)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -Edited by Alastair McIndoe\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1078 4282 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020030521dz5l000g6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
