nt of the capital account, he said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020705dy7500hab\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
