par \par \uc2  48.6850/6950, was estimated to be over-valued by around one \par \par \uc2  percent on a trade-weighted basis. \par \par \uc2      - Apart from checking an undue appreciation, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central \b0 \highlight\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2  bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has also been buying dollars to maintain comfortable \par \par \uc2  reserves position. \par \par \uc2      - As on February 1, the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves were at \par \par \uc2  $49.565 billion, a record high. \par \par \uc2      Previous closing rates: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Call money rates            : 6.50-6.65 percent\par     BSE 30-share Index          : 3,557.06 points (+1.06 pct)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Indicators:\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves (Feb 1): $49.565 bln (+$313 mln for the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par week)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Inflation - wholesale prices (Jan 26) : 1.26 pct yr-on-yr\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     M3 Money supply growth (Jan 25)       : 14.4 pct yr-on-yr\par     Industrial production (Apr-Dec)       : 2.3 pct yr-on-yr\par     Rupee's intra-day low        : 48.7650/dlr on Feb 7, 2002\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     For a speed guide to Reuters treasury coverage, double\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par click on , , .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020020215dy2f005k3\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
