par \uc2  at a state-run bank said. \par \par \uc2      "And the driver will be corporate demand," he added. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said they also expected far forwards to be bid \par \par \uc2  tracking the sentiment in U.S. markets where expectations of \par \par \uc2  another rate cut later this month have risen. \par \par \uc2      For a speed guide to Reuters treasury coverage, double \par \par \uc2  click on , , . \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010712dx6c01vq4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
