t22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves - which are nearly $3 billion down from their mid-April peak of $38.341 billion. \par \par \uc2  Reserves fell sharply in the week to September 8 dragged down by a weak euro, which has fallen nearly 27 percent since its birth in January 1999 and by the weakness of other european \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The official said the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) was unlikely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling dollars or tighten monetary policy at this stage to ward off pressure on the rupee, which is now around six percent below early January levels. \par \par \uc2  The RBI was also not in favour of scrapping the Exchange Earners Foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  (EEFC), a special foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  account for exporters, which was halved last month to increase dollar supplies, he said. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw9j07f8x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
