erves have dipped by nearly $1.2 billion \par \par \uc2  since the start of the current financial year to $36.724 \par \par \uc2  billion on June 16. \par \par \uc2  * Dealers said call money rates will stay high as \par \par \uc2  liquidity was tight in the money market. This has made it \par \par \uc2  costly for banks to hold long dollar positions. \par \par \uc2  * Call money ended at 12.5-12.75 percent on Monday. \par \par \uc2  * The rupee ended firm at 44.655/66 per dollar on Monday, \par \par \uc2  compared to Friday's 44.675/68. \par \par \uc2      * Dealers said premia in the short end will stay bid amid \par \par \uc2  continuing tightness in the money market. \par \par \uc2      * The six-month premium ended at an annualised 3.29 percent \par \par \uc2  on Monday, compared with the previous day's 3.25 percent. \par \par \uc2      . \par \par \uc2    Previous closing rates: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Call money rates\tab \tab   : 12.5-12.75\par   BSE 30-share Index\tab \tab : 4,670.09 (-51.61)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Nasdaq Composite Index: 3,912.12 (+66.78)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dow Jones Indust. Avg : 10,542.99 (+138.24)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indicators:\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves (June 16): $36.724 bln (-0.131)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Inflation-wholesale prices(June 10): 6.21 pct yr-on-yr\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par M3 Money supply growth (June 2): 14.8 pct yr-on-yr\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Rupee's intra-day low: 44.95 on June 8, 2000\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((Bombay Treasury Desk; +91-22-265 9000; fax 91-22-264 1708;\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par bombay.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw6r02xl2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
