ue defending the rupee. \par \par \uc2  * Dealers said call money rates will stay high as \par \par \uc2  liquidity was tight in the money market. This has made it \par \par \uc2  costly for banks to hold long dollar positions. \par \par \uc2      * Call money ended at 11.0-12.0 percent on Saturday, off \par \par \uc2  intra-day high of 13 percent. \par \par \uc2      * The rupee ended slightly weak at 44.675/68 per dollar on \par \par \uc2  Friday, compared to Thursday's 44.6550/6650. \par \par \uc2      * The market is also tracking global crude oil prices which \par \par \uc2  are trading around $32 a barrel. \par \par \uc2      * Dealers said premia to stay bid initially amid the \par \par \uc2  tightness in the money market \par \par \uc2      * The six-month premium ended at an annualised 3.25 percent \par \par \uc2  on Friday, compared with Thursday's 3.21 percent. \par \par \uc2      . \par \par \uc2    Previous closing rates: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Call money rates\tab \tab   : 11.0-12.0\par   BSE 30-share Index\tab \tab : 4,721.70 (+-72.46)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Nasdaq Composite Index: 3,845.34 (-91.50)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dow Jones Indust. Avg : 10,404.75 (+28.63)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indicators:\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves (June 16): $36.724 bln (-0.131)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Inflation-wholesale prices(June 10): 6.21 pct yr-on-yr\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   M3 Money supply growth (June 2)    :  14.8 pct yr-on-yr\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Rupee's intra-day low\tab \tab   :  44.95 on Jun 8, 2000\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ((Bombay Treasury Desk; +91-22-265 9000; fax 91-22-264\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1708; bombay.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw6q02va2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\pic