\par\par \b \uc2  Indian rupee to have firm bias, liquidity weighs. \b0\par\par\uc2 400 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Juni 2000\par 05:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BOMBAY, June 19 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee\tab     will\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par trade in a slightly firm range and traders will eye tight\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  liquidity conditions in the money market. \par \par \uc2      * Waning corporate demand for dollars and sales from \par \par \uc2  exporters might see the Indian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  gain, dealers said. \par \par \uc2      * Dealers said higher call money rates made it costly for \par \par \uc2  banks to hold long dollar positions. \par \par \uc2      * Call money ended at 10.0-12.0 percent on Saturday, off \par \par \uc2  intra-day high of 28 percent. Call rates had risen sharply to \par \par \uc2  30 percent on reporting day on Friday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  did not lend funds through a reverse-repo auction. \par \par \uc2  * Dealers expect the state-run banks will ensure the rupee \par \par \uc2  does not firm too much and are likely to absorb excess dollar \par \par \uc2  inflows. \par \par \uc2      * Bunched inflows over the weekend seen keeping the rupee \par \par \uc2  firm. \par \par \uc2      * The rupee has lost over 2.5 percent since early May. The \par \par \uc2  Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  verbally on June 8 when \par \par \uc2  the rupee fell to intra-day lows of 44.95. \par \par \uc2      India's \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have dipped by $1.18 billion since \par \par \uc2  the start of the current financial to $36.855 billion on June 9 \par \par \uc2  and dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue defending the \par \par \uc2  rupee. \par \par \uc2  * But the rupee has been firming in the past one week after \par \par \uc2  state-run banks, especially the State Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  , \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 44.78. \par \par \uc2  * The rupee ended firm at 44.695/705 per dollar on Friday, \par \par \uc2  compared to Wednesday's 44.69/70. \par \par \uc2      * Importers will eye global crude oil prices which crossed \par \par \uc2   $30 per barrel. \par \par \uc2      * Dealers said premia to stay bid initially amid the \par \par \uc2  tightness in the money market \par \par \uc2      * The six-month premium ended at an annualised 3.43 percent \par \par \uc2  on Friday, compared with Wednesday's 3.24 percent. \par \par \uc2      . \par \par \uc2    Previous closing rates: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Call money rates\tab \tab   : 10-12.0\par   BSE 30-share Index\tab \tab : 4,764.67 (+111.45)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Nasdaq Composite Index: 3,860.56 (+14.82)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dow Jones Indust. Avg : 10,499.30 (-265.52)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indicators:\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves (June 9): $36.855 bln (-0.214)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Inflation-wholesale prices(June 3): 6.43 pct yr-on-yr\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   M3 Money supply growth (May 19)    : 15.1 pct yr-on-yr\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Rupee's intra-day low\tab \tab   : 44.95 on Jun 8, 2000\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    ((Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000; fax 91-22-264 1708;\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par bombay.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw6j037bi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
