ket was sure the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par not tighten liquidity, they said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     * The six-month premium ended at an annualised 3.23 percent\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par on Monday, compared with the previous day's 3.10 percent.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Previous closing rates:\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Call money rates\tab \tab   : 9.25-9.5\par   BSE 30-share Index\tab \tab : 4,639.46 (-90.17)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Nasdaq Composite Index: 3,767.91 (-106.93)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dow Jones Indust. Avg : 10,564.21 (-49.85)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indicators:\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves (June 2): $37.069 bln (-0.255)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Inflation-wholesale prices(May 27): 6.59 pct yr-on-yr\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   M3 Money supply growth (May 19)    : 15.1 pct yr-on-yr\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Rupee's intra-day low\tab \tab   : 44.95 on Jun 8, 2000\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    ((Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000; fax 91-22-264 1708;\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par bombay.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw6d03q5n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
