\par\par \b \uc2  Indian rupee steady, early trade directionless. \b0\par\par\uc2 307 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juni 2000\par 05:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BOMBAY, June 12 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par opened steady and was range-bound in early deals on Monday amid\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  very light dollar purchases. \par \par \uc2      The rupee moved in a 44.7675/79 per dollar range, after \par \par \uc2  opening steady at 44.76/78. \par \par \uc2      It ended at a new closing low of 44.76/78 on Friday amid \par \par \uc2  heavy import demand. \par \par \uc2      "Offers (of dollars) at 44.78 got taken in early deals. But \par \par \uc2  the pace is much slower than what we saw last week," a dealer \par \par \uc2  with a foreign bank said. \par \par \uc2      The rupee has dipped 2.5 percent since early May. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said the Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's (RBI) verbal \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday, when the rupee fell to intra-day lows \par \par \uc2  of 44.95, had eased the pressure. \par \par \uc2      But the market was still uncertain about the direction of \par \par \uc2  the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and whether the slide had ended, they said. \par \par \uc2      Banks were being cautious about long positions, expecting \par \par \uc2  heavy RBI \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and tightening of short-term liquidity \par \par \uc2  if the rupee weakens beyond 45 or the fall is too rapid, they \par \par \uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  Forward premia will also be bid until the volatility in the \par \par \uc2  rupee abates and there are no \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures to tighten \par \par \uc2  liquidity, they said. \par \par \uc2      Higher call rates are also causing the upward spike in \par \par \uc2  near-term premia, they said. \par \par \uc2      The six-month premium ended at an annualised 3.10 percent \par \par \uc2  on Friday, compared with the previous day's 3.06 percent.. \par \par \uc2  Indicators: \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves (June 2): $37.069 bln (-0.255) \par \par \uc2  Inflation-wholesale prices(May 27): 6.59 pct yr-on-yr \par \par \uc2    M3 Money supply growth (May 19)    : 15.1 pct yr-on-yr \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Rupee's intra-day low\tab \tab   : 44.95 on Jun 8, 2000\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    ((Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000; fax 91-22-264 1708;\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par bombay.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw6c03owt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
