\par\par \b \uc2  Indian rupee seen ranged but weak amid uncertainty. \b0\par\par\uc2 336 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juni 2000\par 05:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BOMBAY, June 12 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee\tab     will\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par trade in a wide but weaker range against the dollar amid\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  continuing uncertainty over its direction, dealers said. \par \par \uc2      * The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's (RBI) verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on \par \par \uc2  Thursday when the rupee fell to intra-day lows of 44.95, \par \par \uc2  warning against speculation and asking banks to square \par \par \uc2  positions caused a sharp rebound, has tempered volatility but \par \par \uc2  corporates still unsure where the slide will end. \par \par \uc2  * The rupee has lost over 2.5 percent since early May. \par \par \uc2  It ended at a new closing low of 44.76/78 on Friday amid \par \par \uc2  heavy import demand. \par \par \uc2  * Dealers expect a test of the 45 level soon. But heavy RBI \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and tightening of short-term liquidity likely if \par \par \uc2  the rupee weakens beyond 45 or the fall is too rapid, they \par \par \uc2  said. \par \par \uc2  * At current levels the rupee was fairly valued against its \par \par \uc2  real effective exchange rate and, with the dollar also \par \par \uc2  weakening slightly in global markets, there was no need for it \par \par \uc2  to depreciate further, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  * Forward premia will also be bid until the volatility in \par \par \uc2  the rupee abates and there are no \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures to \par \par \uc2  tighten liquidity, they said. \par \par \uc2      * Higher call rates also causing the upward spike in \par \par \uc2  near-term premia. \par \par \uc2      * The six-month premium ended at an annualised 3.10 percent \par \par \uc2  on Friday, compared with the previous day's 3.06 percent. \par \par \uc2      . \par \par \uc2    Previous closing rates: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Call money rates\tab \tab   : 8.25-8.5\par   BSE 30-share Index\tab \tab : 4,729.63 (-52.8)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Nasdaq Composite Index: 3,874.84 (+49.28)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dow Jones Indust. Avg : 10,614.06 (-54.66)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indicators:\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves (June 2): $37.069 bln (-0.255)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Inflation-wholesale prices(May 27): 6.59 pct yr-on-yr\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   M3 Money supply growth (May 19)    : 15.1 pct yr-on-yr\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Rupee's intra-day low\tab \tab   : 44.95 on Jun 8, 2000\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    ((Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000; fax 91-22-264 1708;\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par bombay.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw6c03owd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
