\par\par \b \uc2  Indian rupee seen treading cautiously,ranged trade. \b0\par\par\uc2 354 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 Juni 2000\par 05:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     BOMBAY, June 9 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee\tab     will\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par open steady and trade will be cautious after Thursday's strong\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2      * Dealers expect a range of 44.72-44.77 per dollar on \par \par \uc2  Friday, with early trade also influenced by actions of \par \par \uc2  corporates and state-run banks. \par \par \uc2      * Banks and corporates are hesitant to purchase dollars \par \par \uc2  above 44.75, the level at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2  twice. \par \par \uc2      * The rupee opened steady and fell rapidly to its lowest \par \par \uc2  intra-day level of 44.95 on Thursday. The Reserve Bank of \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's (RBI) verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , warning against speculation \par \par \uc2  and asking banks to square positions caused a sharp rebound. \par \par \uc2  * The RBI said on Thursday the curbs on holding dollar \par \par \uc2  positions were only applicable on June 8 and there will be no \par \par \uc2  restriction from Friday. \par \par \uc2  * At current levels the rupee was fairly valued against its \par \par \uc2  real effective exchange rate and, with the dollar also \par \par \uc2  weakening slightly in global markets, there was no need for it \par \par \uc2  to depreciate further, dealers said. \par \par \uc2      * Yet, some bearishness could take the rupee to lows of 45 \par \par \uc2  over a week, they said. \par \par \uc2      * The rupee ended Thursday at 44.72/735 per dollar, little \par \par \uc2  changed from its previous 44.725/735. \par \par \uc2      * Forward premia will have a soft bias, but receiving will \par \par \uc2  be limited as the market waits until volatility in the rupee \par \par \uc2  abates and there are no \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures to tighten \par \par \uc2  liquidity. \par \par \uc2      * The six-month premium ended at an annualised 3.06 percent \par \par \uc2  on Thursday, compared with the previous day's 2.9 percent. \par \par \uc2      . \par \par \uc2    Previous closing rates: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Call money rates\tab \tab   : 9.0-9.25\par   BSE 30-share Index\tab \tab : 4,728.81 (+123.97)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Nasdaq Composite Index: 3,825.56 (-13.70)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dow Jones Indust. Avg : 10,668.72 (-144.14).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indicators:\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves     : $37.324 bln (-0.088)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Inflation (wholesale prices)  : 6.3 pct yr-on-yr (-0.08)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par   Rupee's intra-day low\tab    : 44.95 on Jun 8, 2000\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    ((Bombay Newsroom +91-22-265 9000; fax 91-22-264 1708;\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par bombay.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw6903sv1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
