\par\par \b \uc2  Indian rupee ends steady,RBI statement clips trade. \b0\par\par\uc2 343 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Juni 2000\par 12:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BOMBAY, June 8 (Reuters) - The Indian rupee ended little changed from its previous close after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  verbally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to check the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's slide to a record low, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Volumes dropped after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's action and the rupee ended at 44.72/735 per dollar, almost unchanged from Wednesday's close at 44.725/735. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had swung sharply during the day from initial record intra-day lows of 44.95 to firmer levels around 44.58. \par \par \uc2  The Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  (RBI) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the rupee fell sharply in morning trade, warning against speculative positions and asking banks to unwind long positions. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said trade came to a near standstill after the RBI statement, with most banks opting to just cover corporate transactions. \par \par \uc2  State-run banks were active in the market, absorbing dollars offloaded by other players and buying dollars at times, they said. \par \par \uc2  Most were also confused about the direction for the rupee. \par \par \uc2  "If they indicate comfort levels, then that will bring in exporters and importers and automatically reinforce a range for the rupee. This way, one cannot even form a view," the chief dealer of a foreign bank said. \par \par \uc2  There was a lot of wariness about buying dollars above 44.75, the level at which the RBI has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice. The earlier occasion was on May 25. \par \par \uc2  But dealers said a range of 44.72-44.77 was likely on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Most were also uncertain about whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will extend its restrictions on banks' dollar positions to the next few days. \par \par \uc2  "Traders are going home with square positions today, so tomorrow morning will be steady," a dealer with a state-run bank said. \par \par \uc2  Forward dollar premia ended higher, amid light paying towards close after being steady through the day. \par \par \uc2  The six-month premium ended at an annualised 3.06 percent compared with Wednesday's 2.90. \par \par \uc2  ((Bombay Treasury Desk; +91-22-265 9000; fax 91-22-264 1708; vidya.ranganathan@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010820dw68040zq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
